cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SONAPSE MORPHOGENESIS v2.0: Autonomous Developmental Connectome Intelligence & OMNI Max Mode"
message: "If you use SONAPSE MORPHOGENESIS or Sonapse-LAB in your research, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kai
    family-names: Piper
    alias: kai9987kai
abstract: >-
  Autonomous developmental connectome research platform built on Sonapse-LAB (0.3.0),
  featuring a vectorized CompiledConnectomeEngine, 36 custom graft neuron families,
  21 conventional neurons, 20 gated synthetic organelles, 33 learning rules, 18 ML hybrids,
  16 bio hybrids, 32 biological/artificial senses, causal emergence & cross-yoked twin assays,
  and OMNI-MORPHOGENESIS 3-tier nested oscillatory Max Mode. Synthetic CPU-first research
  software; no claim of biological fidelity or subjective experience.
